===============================================================================

BetterStructureSql has been installed!

Configuration file created at:
  config/initializers/better_structure_sql.rb

Generate a clean schema dump:
  rails db:schema:dump_better

To replace Rails' default dump and load tasks, set in the initializer:
  config.replace_default_dump = true
  config.replace_default_load = true

Then the standard commands use BetterStructureSql:
  rails db:schema:dump
  rails db:schema:load

Schema versioning (optional):
  1. Set config.enable_schema_versions = true in the initializer
  2. rails db:migrate             # creates the schema versions table
  3. rails db:schema:store        # store the current dump
  4. rails db:schema:versions     # list stored versions
  5. rails db:schema:cleanup      # apply the retention limit

The web UI for stored versions fails closed outside development and test:
configure access with BetterStructureSql::Engine.authenticate_with { ... }
or BetterStructureSql::Engine.authentication_handled_by_routes!

Documentation: https://github.com/sebyx07/better_structure_sql

===============================================================================
